  <title>Taula-nabigazioaren hobespenak</title>
  <p>
    The following options allow you to customize how <app>Orca</app>
    behaves when navigating within a table in
    <link xref="howto_structural_navigation">Structural-Navigation</link>-enabled
    applications.
  </p>
  <section id="speak_cell_coordinates">
    <title>Esan gelaxka-koordenatuak</title>
    <p>Kontrol-lauki hau markatuta badago, <app>Orcak</app> nabigatzean zoazen gelaxken koordenatuak esango ditu.</p>
    <p>Balio lehenetsia: markatuta</p>
  </section>
  <section id="speak_multiple_cell_spans">
    <title>Irakurri gelaxka anitzeko gelaxken tamaina</title>
    <p>Kontrol-lauki hau markatuta badago, <app>Orcak</app> gelaxka anitzeko gelaxka batek zenbat errenkadatan edota zutabetan zabaltzen den esango du.</p>
    <p>Balio lehenetsia: markatuta</p>
  </section>
  <section id="announce_cell_header">
    <title>Iragarri gelaxken goiburua</title>
    <p>
      If this checkbox is checked, <app>Orca</app> will announce changes in the
      header if the headers for the current cell can be determined.
    </p>
    <p>Balio lehenetsia: markatuta</p>
  </section>
  <section id="skip_blank_cells">
    <title>Saltatu gelaxka hutsak</title>
    <p>
      If this checkbox is checked, <app>Orca</app> will skip blank cells when
      you are using <app>Orca</app>'s table structural navigation commands to
      access the table.
    </p>
    <p>Balio lehenetsia: markatu gabe</p>
  </section>
</page>
